# Portfolio — Kellan Mc Naughton

Personal portfolio site built from scratch to showcase professional work and personal projects.

Live at: https://mckwakkle.github.io/portfolio

## Built With

- HTML5
- SCSS (compiled to CSS via Dart Sass)
- Vanilla JavaScript
- Font Awesome

## Running Locally
```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Watch and compile SCSS
npm run watch
```

Open `index.html` directly in your browser — no build server required.

## Structure
```
src/scss/        # SCSS source files
dist/css/        # Compiled CSS output
js/              # JavaScript
assets/          # Images and CV
```